                <syl /><neume facs="#m-d620273b-d083-427e-8cce-64ebb9658df8" type="podatus" xml:id="m-9bde977e-3bbc-44c7-bf9c-87992cfd99ff">
                  <nc xml:id="m-bde81693-403c-408c-a303-50085fb4c39b" pname="b" oct="3" /><nc xml:id="m-10c0fe8a-8978-4a97-ac5a-42f870b88a2f" pname="c" oct="4" /></neume></syllable><syllable xml:id="m-22ad1ad7-e748-4a99-857c-6ddf5fc8120e">
                <syl /><neume facs="#m-bbe57137-c9eb-4b31-9ade-60a07dbd1f3d" type="punctum" xml:id="m-e2143af2-341a-4cda-88a5-5b36636a8e1f">
                  <nc xml:id="m-8ef85135-7aca-4050-9b31-87c4abda79da" pname="a" oct="3" tilt="se" /></neume></syllable><syllable xml:id="m-917c383a-ddd7-4089-ae03-6d14b1db2a73">
                <syl /><neume facs="#m-f59ae72a-0adc-4cd7-9787-2095f6817198" type="punctum" xml:id="m-cc28bce9-c887-4450-b787-fff58cb1b5f9">
                  <nc xml:id="m-bdc8c7db-06bd-4965-9f29-51cdad7b0ec4" pname="g" oct="3" tilt="se" /></neume></syllable><divLine xml:id="m-aaad5080-3e90-4ab6-b241-b616124f2202" facs="#m-1004aeab-3c8f-4b5b-ae60-59d42699a142" form="minima" /><custos xml:id="m-91099085-e473-4807-92ad-83473a2c9854" facs="#m-452c513e-0e43-414f-9024-a4ec109fb3aa" pname="a" oct="3" /></layer></staff><div xml:id="m-5e8e305a-b16c-4d1d-bc7c-25e1edac45f5"><lg xml:id="m-6cac2805-5f7e-49e0-99fa-1eb5aecffd75"><l xml:id="m-5bff73fc-48ae-4c73-85b1-81e73ddf5046" facs="#m-672373c9-144b-411f-86fc-394e156c9ce4" label="ambiguous">1502</l><l xml:id="m-90e42819-c22b-444a-b287-c50a7668ade3" facs="#m-44128063-ae18-40ed-9251-51a22799ace9" label="ambiguous">July 20.</l><l xml:id="m-476b164c-27ec-4622-b846-d7f5178693ba" facs="#m-b04830c6-d3b1-4641-848c-fdeabe6edf34" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-76a0ed7f-c6e1-4eb1-9ad2-8c4cf6eaae32" facs="#m-da59bf2f-126c-4d91-b77e-67a4e442a287" label="lyrics-like">Eus misericordiárum pater, per concéde; ut spiritum adoptiónis,</l><l xml:id="m-874b57d0-e26a-41cf-8324-180a2ddee58b" facs="#m-5f25ed96-f1e2-4205-b25e-c3eb9f7777de" label="lyrics-like">mérita et intercessiónem beátil quo filii tui nominámur et sumus,</l><l xml:id="m-13323918-977f-4fc6-93e8-6045a7243df0" facs="#m-fab2da02-c641-4336-b064-6e5bc08d0700" label="lyrics-like">Hierónymi, quem órphanis adju- fidéliter custodiámus. Per Dóminum</l><l xml:id="m-fa9384b3-ff09-410f-859f-b375641b25d2" facs="#m-400d2154-1d46-489b-89c4-5a2b8e9ac789" label="lyrics-like">tórem et patrem esse voluisti: t nostrum.</l><l xml:id="m-7747764f-4e4a-45fc-bcef-9632565c7b43" facs="#m-1b2b8026-b116-4997-b749-1a44dfdb2762" label="lyrics-like">Commemoration of St. Margaret, V. M. (Mass Me exspectavérunt. p. 1220.)</l><l xml:id="m-8bd75899-2fce-4566-b76b-6a232d74e7b6" facs="#m-19ae1b6a-ba19-4ed5-b959-364f514b81ab" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-585fd8c1-85b3-4421-bee6-bc7cef9119b1" facs="#m-d0f80881-684b-4e68-918c-0c4e3331ca44" label="lyrics-like">"Ndulgéntiam nobis, quaésumus l grata semper éxstitit et mérito ca¬</l><l xml:id="m-360942b3-9bd9-4d99-966c-bcd7fbd6cef7" facs="#m-5cb29ef8-d7b4-405b-9a71-8aa5ec8addfc" label="lyrics-like">I Dómine, beáta Margarita Virgo stitátis, et tuae professióne virtútis.</l><l xml:id="m-f086617a-ac12-466a-9f4d-edafe0e6d2fc" facs="#m-19836708-cbf9-48e1-ae43-e4042d968480" label="lyrics-like">et Martyr implóret:*quae tibi lPer Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-217a1e85-dd7b-41bf-b0a3-3eb522d387c9" facs="#m-19025610-a9a2-42a2-99d0-956e714dbd6f" label="text-like">Lectio Isaiae Prophetae. Is. 58. b.</l><l xml:id="m-93b0a3a5-a586-479a-8e4a-8f6f4eebd9aa" facs="#m-7a99b35f-7cc3-45d9-b880-65b5558efe72" label="lyrics-like">Aec dicit Dóminus: Frange esu-[et desíeris exténdere dígitum, et</l><l xml:id="m-95c70f1d-6968-4072-8762-988da5e74866" facs="#m-41240935-e5ac-493b-aaa3-834144d5ce45" label="lyrics-like">It riénti panem tuum, et egénos loqui quod non prodest. Cum effú¬</l><l xml:id="m-baba6000-1147-4377-bbc0-191d3e5d4698" facs="#m-66ad8542-0522-452a-b410-e6b27699a138" label="lyrics-like">deris esuriénti ánimam tuam, et</l><l xml:id="m-44d2069f-2408-4c59-bb89-9656a5612135" facs="#m-2dd44ab9-660f-4cdb-88c6-b1ca41de20be" label="lyrics-like">vagósque induc in domum tuam:</l><l xml:id="m-039e2c25-cfdf-4840-a0c1-854a57db59a9" facs="#m-c46c8a51-4b62-4f0f-b2c9-8fe02248fd1a" label="lyrics-like">ánimam afflictam repléveris, orié¬</l><l xml:id="m-fca069d1-456f-4851-9e2f-6a8a122292bd" facs="#m-5ff72718-b573-4628-8a1f-e71033197462" label="lyrics-like">cum videris nudum, óperi eum, et</l><l xml:id="m-42668d4d-15d4-4fba-b6e1-7ef962ba0903" facs="#m-8d7d9496-9570-457e-b318-18a39a12c667" label="lyrics-like">tur in ténebris lux tua, et ténebrae</l><l xml:id="m-0c69dbf8-2887-4a12-98b3-8f7501936663" facs="#m-1430bc01-3fc0-4139-9f92-0c043db023b4" label="lyrics-like">carnem tuam ne despéxeris. Tunc</l><l xml:id="m-5387d07c-fa14-4fc2-96f3-5b346aab706a" facs="#m-b7443068-4bf4-4a38-b0be-1acc3d149ff8" label="lyrics-like">tuae erunt sicut merídies. Et ré¬</l><l xml:id="m-525c0673-054c-4e0b-ac7d-6944b1fd2a06" facs="#m-cd5894fb-8177-425a-8781-4789489520a9" label="lyrics-like">erúmpet quasi mane lumen tuum,</l><l xml:id="m-b271c749-1caf-4082-b03f-88f673627ebf" facs="#m-eecfa747-dc03-4260-95ca-d526f5e1644f" label="lyrics-like">et sánitas tua cítius oriétur, et an¬</l><l xml:id="m-93513bdd-c841-4310-85ba-b2dae1138c0d" facs="#m-be067583-518c-4ec8-88b6-18a79bc0b0bb" label="lyrics-like">quiem tibi dabit Dóminus semper,</l><l xml:id="m-e316ebba-705a-456f-9233-271c2698edcc" facs="#m-601a79ff-4126-483e-8003-be418471c0a2" label="lyrics-like">tesbit fáciem tuam justitia tua, et</l><l xml:id="m-b02085fc-558e-464f-acaa-186251a2be2d" facs="#m-612333a5-009c-4c54-83cb-cd53818901a6" label="lyrics-like">et implébit splendóribus ánimam</l><l xml:id="m-0102a351-07e2-4048-938a-d10f8c91b092" facs="#m-e5bc0b39-414c-4e5a-906b-16c9cb0387e6" label="lyrics-like">glórla Dómini cólliget te. Tunc</l><l xml:id="m-1f3b0eef-c0ca-427e-a3a9-62126f87ccf6" facs="#m-8884c805-8274-4501-bde4-10423a2216cb" label="lyrics-like">tuam, et ossa tua liberábit, et eris</l><l xml:id="m-76afb841-ff87-452f-9828-c8937d205d96" facs="#m-ac3bcac2-257e-4d19-a1fe-5aed9bab70d4" label="lyrics-like">invocábis, et Dóminus exáudiet:</l><l xml:id="m-f688e662-72a8-4be7-b13e-44819bd89663" facs="#m-8039a10a-4a78-4980-b464-95e4f424a230" label="lyrics-like">quasi hortus irríguus, et sicut fons</l><l xml:id="m-cad0dc6e-4905-430c-933b-324a851794fc" facs="#m-f54176e8-8d20-4386-98e2-324c5e5ef9f6" label="lyrics-like">clamábis, et dicet: Ecce adsum;</l><l xml:id="m-3730e7a9-b80b-4845-996a-d9d0bd3a7f22" facs="#m-34c83d23-fbd9-480e-8813-1e3eb6d3b10c" label="lyrics-like">aquárum cujus non deficient aquae.</l><l xml:id="m-3748e414-8bbc-4f00-add6-11fdb9780583" facs="#m-358b4b78-ef83-4fcd-8d5e-7f738f9ff64b" label="lyrics-like">si abstúleris de médio tui caténam,</l><l xml:id="m-5520510b-730c-42fe-9c3f-b10994f8cb52" facs="#m-9aeefe0c-0d34-499d-bed8-3d0df3edb600" label="ambiguous">Grad.</l><l xml:id="m-88693cf9-b1e6-429f-a391-5bcc89c192f1" facs="#m-062e2b6e-4670-425e-8672-47cbf287c107" label="ambiguous">2.</l><l xml:id="m-ee450e7f-c979-4fdc-be58-cf9f87954794" facs="#m-8e043542-1ae7-4638-bd0b-ded33ee29f5e" label="lyrics-like">DErivéntur" fón-tes tú¬i</l><l xml:id="m-07ea8c98-ed49-4a16-a9e2-530c1bf010fc" facs="#m-b8522557-4927-46f7-9ed0-4f68a07ba42b" label="ambiguous">fo¬</l><l xml:id="m-a8f93c5b-83f3-489a-abe9-d70fa34fc7e0" facs="#m-680a0ee8-5283-4a82-88cf-d1c058f80d14" label="ambiguous">ras,</l><l xml:id="m-acd99ee0-fe3d-477a-9d16-0cdd2aee81cf" facs="#m-4e6a35c9-d62e-443c-90f7-a4d077fdbe5b" label="ambiguous">di¬</l><l xml:id="m-dd2df0de-e6e6-4706-aa71-c5a1632f242b" facs="#m-7cbc489a-ef18-484d-aa5b-3c83f3f1fa15" label="lyrics-like">et in platé¬ is</l><l xml:id="m-9214cea5-ebef-46fd-ac82-7aeb7a0aa3a8" facs="#m-670cc808-6578-438c-8ee1-79df5ce6c406" label="lyrics-like">áquas tú¬a</l><l xml:id="m-d9a3bbd5-93e7-49a3-b8bb-ac8240fe0610" facs="#m-95424e93-b5e9-47c2-9e86-77cf3c97c689" label="ambiguous">vi¬</l><l xml:id="m-4c3941ab-7304-408c-9f6f-2a0de3d5c6a2" facs="#m-bff870ad-ebf6-4bdc-9cb9-f46b928a2230" label="lyrics-like">V. Jucúndus hó¬</l><l xml:id="m-413e67db-8bdb-48d1-8616-60292b205128" facs="#m-9336a292-dcb9-4671-9b49-6aad7db480ca" label="ambiguous">de.</l><l xml:id="m-0fd2300a-e23b-44af-a2a4-5327205bb602" facs="#m-0dcb35e0-cea0-48d4-afd3-17177fd390c5" label="lyrics-like">mi-seré-tur, et cóm¬</l><l xml:id="m-3956d181-c484-4fbc-8561-0f7384fe00e8" facs="#m-e4651602-297e-4eff-9ad3-1d757b3d1dd7" label="ambiguous">qui</l><l xml:id="m-4baeaeb2-4657-46f4-beea-35dca5179753" facs="#m-7737878b-18cb-44d7-a477-ef321fa24b8d" label="ambiguous">mo,</l><l xml:id="m-72ef5ce0-f6da-40a8-a7ae-bf634180d964" facs="#m-16947d95-2a3f-413c-a837-25c9a09bbf49" label="lyrics-like">mo- dat: dispó-net</l><l xml:id="m-7ec7e934-408f-462a-96b1-b615032adaf2" facs="#m-1724c4ca-8743-4d0a-a468-7e218fe46300" label="lyrics-like">sermónes sú¬ o</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
